# M-ALL04 -- W2-CA-08 sea reinforcement delivery. ALL04u: the AMCV landing
# team (AMCV + LCRF at sea waypoint 2) sails in; W4-SQ-01: the AMCV rides
# INSIDE the landing craft (Full=yes), so the player drives the craft onto
# the beach and unloads it (Deploy key); the MCV then drives to a legal spot
# and unfolds into a ConYard. Cheat: camp_deploy = the player's move + deploy.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL04u.MAP GDI

until 60 scene == campaign-load
require scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
require scene == game
assert mode == campaign
until 3000 units(0) >= 8
assert units(0) >= 8
# R-210: the landing craft now enter on the water at the sea waypoint and
# sail in under their team script; an order given before the team reaches
# its landing point is overridden by the team's next move. Wait for the
# landing (the Soviet garrison teams are in place by then, as in m-all04-real).
until 2000 in_garrison(1) >= 20
until 2000 moving(0) == 0
click unit 0:LCRF
click cell 120 68
until 1200 moving(0) == 0
click unit 0:LCRF
key d
wait 5
until 600 carried(0) == 0
cheat camp_move E1 115 45
cheat camp_move GI 115 45
cheat camp_move MTNK 115 45
wait 300
cheat camp_deploy
wait 900
cheat camp_deploy
until 900 buildings(0) >= 1
assert buildings(0) >= 1
